[en.CHARACTER_SUGAR_BELLE_NAME]
Sugar Belle

[en.CHARACTER_SUGAR_BELLE_DESC]
Sugar Belle’s fate is like a train passing through a tunnel, alternating between light and darkness — perhaps that’s not the most fitting metaphor.
In any case, she endured a difficult first half of her life in Our Town. After regaining freedom in Our Town, she found her lifelong love, Big Mac, and moved to Ponyville. However, with the agricultural reforms in Ponyville, the apple trees in Sweet Apple Acres, along with their idyllic life, were mercilessly cut down.
She and Big Mac boarded that train full of secrets and hope towards Our Town, but at the end of the tunnel, she alone arrived at the destination of the journey.

[zh.CHARACTER_SUGAR_BELLE_NAME]
糖蓓儿

[zh.CHARACTER_SUGAR_BELLE_DESC]
糖蓓儿的命运如一列穿越隧道的火车，交替着光明与黑暗——也许这不是一个很合适的比喻。
总之，她在平等镇度过了苦难的前半生；在平等镇重获自由后，她也找到了一生的挚爱大麦，并搬去了小马谷。但随着小马谷农业改革，香甜苹果园的苹果树也和他们的美好生活一起被无情地砍断。
她与大麦一起登上了前往平等镇的那辆充满秘密和希望的火车，而在隧道的那头，最终却只有她一个抵达了旅程的终点。
